## 3. Android APK & DEX Decompilation (`jadx` CLI)

Decompile Android packages directly to structured Java source without intermediate MCP servers:

### Fast Targeted Decompilation
```bash
# Decompile whole APK (sources only, skips heavy media/assets)
jadx -d ./decompiled_src --no-res --show-bad-code target.apk

# Decompile specific class only
jadx -d ./decompiled_src --single-class "com.example.app.MainActivity" target.apk

# Extract AndroidManifest.xml only
jadx -d ./decompiled_manifest --no-src target.apk
```

